@startuml
skinparam dpi 140
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
title A — Main delivery scenario
autonumber
participant "Bank service" as Bank
queue Kafka
participant "Delivery Control" as Control
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "Channel Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Push / App" as Push
Bank -> Bank: Commit operation + source outbox
Bank -> Kafka: CDC business event (stable key)
Kafka -> Control: Consume critical event
Control -> DB: BEGIN: dedup + notification + outbox; COMMIT
Control -> Kafka: Commit input offset
Control -> DB: Reserve push + deadline + command outbox
Control -> Kafka: CDC send command
Kafka -> Gateway: Push attempt (stable attempt_id)
Gateway -> Gateway: Verify current state, policy and contact
Gateway -> Push: Send push with stable provider key
Push --> Gateway: Accepted (NOT delivered)
Gateway -> DB: Save PROVIDER_ACCEPTED
Push -> Gateway: Authenticated device ACK
Gateway -> DB: Inbox + lock notification\nDELIVERED + audit/outbox; COMMIT
note over Control,DB
First positive evidence wins.
History and analytics update asynchronously.
end note
@enduml
